# ahead of the Conflict Pawn (toward P2). Every other take-card turn discards the first accessible card (2 coins: nobody builds a yellow card). Reveals come from RandomChanceSource(35); other decisions take the first legal Move.
# Nobody produces anything, so every missing resource costs 2 coins. The working is in PantheonScenarioTests.War.
